thLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Explanation_by_MathTalks_Now\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Explanation by MathTalks_Now</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Super_easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Super easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/4/c1483a016785d8481f90f7b8a41b9480bd806ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8 \\times 4 + 2) - (8 + 4 \\times 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/2/5a2cf6341b2d680d59cf0be9ea17d2124a745512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca65b4deda49fe016bb9a5e17aa20b0b81e87a39.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(8 \\times 4 + 2) - (8 + 4 \\times 2) = (32+2) - (8+8) = 34 - 16 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 18}.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"28\" />\n~apex304, TaeKim, MRENTHUSIASM, sandville_kris\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simplify the expression above in another way: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/3/6234432209092a582bac14d392cbfca5ee640b6e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(8 \\times 4 + 2) - (8 + 4 \\times 2)=8\\times4+2-8-4\\times2=32+2-8-8=34-16=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 18}.\\]\" width=\"580\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_InterestingMathProblems\">Video Solution by InterestingMathProblems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by InterestingMathProblems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Pf93RGtKo1I?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/Pf93RGtKo1I?feature=shared</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=29\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=29</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28How_to_Creatively_Think.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(How_to_Creatively_Think!!!)\">Video Solution (How to Creatively Think!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsecti